      ],
      "narrative": "On 2 September 2026 at about 23:45 hours the complainant Sunita Kale, who runs a jewellery shop at Hadapsar, Pune, was closing the shop when two persons on a black Pulsar bearing registration MH 14 CD 5678 snatched a bag containing cash of Rs. 4,50,000 and gold ornaments. The complainant identified the pillion rider as Farid Khan, a known member of the Hadapsar Syndicate run by Imran Shaikh. Witness Anil Bhosale, a former associate of Farid Khan, stated that Farid Khan had been watching the shop for a week. Offence registered under BNS 304(2), 309(4) and 3(5) against Imran Shaikh and Farid Khan.",
